00:28:48.655 --> 00:28:51.416
I never thought the mechanism in that
spot...

00:28:52.516 --> 00:28:53.936
This is really well designed.

00:28:53.936 --> 00:28:55.696
That was a nasty one.

00:28:55.957 --> 00:28:57.977
Flip that over, then just keep going.

00:28:58.057 --> 00:29:00.938
So now all that's left is, uh, Minamikawa.

00:29:00.938 --> 00:29:01.938
Yeah.

00:29:02.518 --> 00:29:07.999
We modified the Mini 4WD track, so the
question is how that comes into play.

00:29:08.259 --> 00:29:13.500
Right. Maybe something comes out from
there, or they send something in to help us.

00:29:13.700 --> 00:29:14.700
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:29:15.121 --> 00:29:16.121
Yeah.

00:29:16.121 --> 00:29:17.121
Now it's all about Kuro-chan.

00:29:18.161 --> 00:29:21.862
The question is how he helps everyone. So
far, everybody's been helping each other quite a bit.

00:29:22.942 --> 00:29:24.443
Yeah, they've definitely been helping.

00:29:24.903 --> 00:29:26.343
Yeah, supporting each other and all that.

00:29:26.463 --> 00:29:27.463
Yeah.

00:29:27.783 --> 00:29:31.784
That suspended pair did manage to get out
in the end, though.

00:29:33.205 --> 00:29:36.065
But that ramen recovery scene was
something else.

00:29:36.265 --> 00:29:37.345
That was brutal.

00:29:37.696 --> 00:29:38.696
It was hard to watch.

00:29:38.766 --> 00:29:39.766
Really hard to watch.

00:29:41.046 --> 00:29:43.147
They threw the toppings over, and they had
to catch them.

00:29:43.247 --> 00:29:46.887
Then they just scarfed down the noodles.

00:29:48.608 --> 00:29:50.168
And somehow they still ate it.
Unbelievable.

00:29:50.428 --> 00:29:53.289
That whole exchange was wild.

00:29:53.389 --> 00:29:57.670
Watching them toss over the toppings and
noodles one by one so they could slurp them down...

00:29:58.990 --> 00:29:59.990
That was really something.
